[{"i":0,"text":"Language is not just the words we speak.","startMs":3174,"endMs":5286},{"i":1,"text":"It is a memory that carries the history, traditions, and sacred places of a land across generations.","startMs":5706,"endMs":10242},{"i":2,"text":"For example… there is such an interesting story behind Telugu.","startMs":10922,"endMs":13922},{"i":3,"text":"Srisailam.","startMs":14602,"endMs":15178},{"i":4,"text":"Kaleshwaram.","startMs":15598,"endMs":16294},{"i":5,"text":"Draksharamam.","startMs":16714,"endMs":17410},{"i":6,"text":"There is an ancient tradition of calling the region connected with these three great Shiva kshetras","startMs":18090,"endMs":22506},{"i":7,"text":"“Trilinga Desam”.","startMs":22926,"endMs":23814},{"i":8,"text":"There is also an ancient belief that the name Telugu","startMs":24494,"endMs":26990},{"i":9,"text":"came from that Trilingam.","startMs":27410,"endMs":28490},{"i":10,"text":"Just think for a moment…","startMs":29170,"endMs":30634},{"i":11,"text":"Language… land… devotion…","startMs":31314,"endMs":33426},{"i":12,"text":"This is an idea that connected all three,","startMs":33846,"endMs":36198},{"i":13,"text":"making generations remember it.","startMs":36618,"endMs":38154},{"i":14,"text":"Sanatana did not just give us traditions.","startMs":38834,"endMs":40946},{"i":15,"text":"It provided a culture connected with land, kshetras, and language","startMs":41366,"endMs":44942},{"i":16,"text":"to generations.","startMs":45362,"endMs":46370},{"i":17,"text":"Kings changed.","startMs":47050,"endMs":47866},{"i":18,"text":"Kingdoms changed.","startMs":48286,"endMs":49174},{"i":19,"text":"Borders changed.","startMs":49594,"endMs":50602},{"i":20,"text":"But kshetras remained.","startMs":51282,"endMs":52362},{"i":21,"text":"Languages remained.","startMs":52782,"endMs":53742},{"i":22,"text":"Through them, culture remained.","startMs":54162,"endMs":55314},{"i":23,"text":"**Language is the identity of our culture…","startMs":55994,"endMs":58298},{"i":24,"text":"Not a wall between us.**","startMs":58978,"endMs":60178},{"i":25,"text":"Because…","startMs":60858,"endMs":61434},{"i":26,"text":"Language should recognize us.","startMs":61854,"endMs":63390},{"i":27,"text":"It should not divide us.","startMs":63810,"endMs":65082},{"i":28,"text":"❤️","startMs":65302,"endMs":65302},{"i":29,"text":"Note: The belief that the name “Telugu” came from “Trilingam” is one of the ancient opinions regarding the origin of the Telugu name.","startMs":65982,"endMs":72558}]